year 2029</b> through the following initiatives:</p>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"gdlr-core-pbf-element\">\n                                                <div class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-item gdlr-core-item-pdlr gdlr-core-item-pdb  gdlr-core-icon-list-with-background-circle\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n                                                    <ul>\n                                                        <li class=\" gdlr-core-skin-divider gdlr-core-with-hover\"><span class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon-wrap gdlr-core-skin-e-background\" style=\"background-color: #51b0f3 ;\"><i class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon-hover fa fa-leaf gdlr-core-skin-e-content\" style=\"color: #f9f9f9;font-size: 13px;width: 13px;\"></i><i class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon fa fa-leaf gdlr-core-skin-e-content\" style=\"color: #f9f9f9;font-size: 13px;width: 13px;\"></i></span><span class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-content\">1,160 KW of solar panel capacity on site</span></li>\n                                                        <li class=\" gdlr-core-skin-divider gdlr-core-with-hover\"><span class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon-wrap gdlr-core-skin-e-background\" style=\"background-color: #51b0f3 ;\"><i class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon-hover fa fa-leaf gdlr-core-skin-e-content\" style=\"color: #f9f9f9;font-size: 13px;width: 13px;\"></i><i class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon fa fa-leaf gdlr-core-skin-e-content\" style=\"color: #f9f9f9;font-size: 13px;width: 13px;\"></i></span><span class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-content\">Daylight and LED lighting (reduce 0.50%)</span></li>\n                                                        <li class=\" gdlr-core-skin-divider gdlr-core-with-hover\"><span class=\"gdlr-core-icon-list-icon-wrap gdlr-core-skin-e-background\" style=\"background-color: #51b0f3 ;\"><i